      "message": "chore(site): refresh the graph after the dsh-github release\n\nThe sync ran after the tag but before the publish workflow finished, and the\nsession timed out before the generated file was staged. Regenerating at the\nreleased head (89b6b3f) is idempotent, so this is the same graph the site\nwould build today: dsh-github's two feature commits, the merge and the gate\nfix, plus the tag node.",
